  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Found abandoned as a hatchling in the ruins of the old skater park, Sk8r Boi was raised by a pack of feral pigeons who taught him the brutal ways of Subchain City. His growler vest, scavenged from a fallen raider, and custom Sk8rs DDCs are his only connection to the life he once knew before the DRIP wars.",
    "class": "Skirmisher",
    "name": "Sk8r Boi",
